  "reasoning": "The product is a pinacolboronate ester where boron is coordinated to two oxygens from a pinacol diol, with one oxygen linked to a phenyl ring bearing a para-cyclopropylcarboxamide substituent. For FGI of a boronic ester, the disconnection breaks the B-O bonds to regenerate the parent boronic acid and the diol. The arylboronic acid precursor is 4-(cyclopropylcarbamoyl)phenylboronic acid (O=C(NC1CC1)c2ccc(B(O)O)cc2), and pinacol (OCC(O)C(C)(C)) is the diol component. Both are required reactants for the forward esterification reaction.",
